---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy" description="What we collect (almost nothing), what we don't collect (almost everything), and how to reach us.">
  <div class="container-page max-w-3xl py-16 prose-mdx">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-ink-500">Last updated: August 2026</p>
    <h2>TL;DR</h2>
    <p>We collect almost nothing. No user accounts, no email addresses (unless you email us first), no third-party tracking scripts, no data sales. Only Cloudflare Web Analytics (aggregate, cookie-free) and AdSense (if enabled).</p>
    <h2>What we collect</h2>
    <h3>Cloudflare Web Analytics</h3>
    <p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is privacy-first: no cookies, no personal data, no fingerprinting, GDPR-compliant. It tells us aggregate page views. That's it.</p>
    <h3>Google AdSense (if enabled)</h3>
    <p>If we enable AdSense, Google may set cookies per its own policy. You can opt out at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">adssettings.google.com</a>. We only see aggregate revenue reports.</p>
    <h2>What we do NOT collect</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Email addresses (unless you email us first)</li>
      <li>Names, profiles, or any user account data (we have no user accounts)</li>
      <li>IP addresses (Cloudflare Web Analytics strips them)</li>
      <li>Device fingerprints or tracking identifiers</li>
      <li>Behavioral data from third-party trackers (we have none)</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>We set no cookies. If AdSense is enabled, Google may set its own. Clear or block them in your browser at any time.</p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Since we collect essentially no personal data, there's nothing to delete. If you emailed us and want that conversation deleted, reply and ask. We will within 7 days.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Use the <a href="/contact">contact form</a> or open an issue on <a href="https://github.com/appenzellerdigitalstore-stack/opensourcestack/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
